  "reflectionText": "After Nathan came to him, David prayed: have mercy on me. Wash me thoroughly. Create in me a clean heart. The lamps burned low in the chamber, and he did not move from where he sat. How does a heart get made clean again by the One whose name has been sinned against in the room?"
